      "display_excerpt": "- REPORT_ESTIMATE: report concentration estimate with source method and range.\n- REPEAT_SAMPLE: remix, take two additional readings, and recompute the median.\n- FLAG_OUT_OF_RANGE: do not extrapolate above 500 NTU or below the blank-corrected measurement limit.\n- INVALID_MEASUREMENT: stop if blank drift, cell contamination, or replicate spread exceeds the method limits.\n",
